  m_Text: '<color=#80F2FF>MOVE</color>

    WASD or arrow keys. Swipe on mobile.


    <color=#80F2FF>POWER
    SHOT</color>

    Space, when the power meter is full.


    <color=#80F2FF>USE
    ABILITY</color>

    E, when one is stored.


    <color=#80F2FF>PAUSE</color>

    Esc,
    or the pause button.


    <color=#80F2FF>GOAL</color>

    Leave safe territory
    to draw a trail, then reconnect to capture space. Capture 75% to clear the stage.'
